POST-QUANTUM REFERENCE MATERIAL
================================================================================

`tools/pq/kat_mldsa44.rsp` is the NIST known-answer test file for ML-DSA-44
(FIPS 204), used only to check `src/pq/`. The ML-DSA and MAYO implementations
under `src/pq/` are original work under Apache-2.0, checked byte for byte
against the reference implementations named in `tools/pq/`.
